# STATEFUL brick 2 (minio). Secrets via EnvironmentFile=secrets.env (single-source spine; rotation=1-file edit).
# Image: docker.io/bitnamilegacy/minio:latest  (parity ref (captured tag)). No Exec set -> image default entrypoint/CMD runs (server /data, console :9001).
# Host-publish is LOOPBACK-only (secure perimeter); traefik/n8n reach minio over the 'aether' net by hostname
#   minio:9000, unaffected by the loopback host bind. Override for LAN console: change 127.0.0.1: -> 0.0.0.0: (not advised; route via traefik+zitadel auth instead).
# Object/S3 semantics NOT probed here (a stray file in /data pollutes the bucket namespace) -> proven at Lane-A.
# CONSOLE-PLACEMENT(J2-probe): 9010/ answers as S3 endpoint (root=403, XML/AccessDenied); web console NOT co-served; 9011 not listening. S3 API green (live=200 ready=200) is the steel thread and is all Lane-A needs. Do NOT override Exec (would bypass J1 first-run mc setup). Console, if wanted later, via supported env verified in docs, not guessed. image=docker.io/bitnamilegacy/minio:latest.
# Known debt: EnvironmentFile injects ALL spine keys (env-spread); proper fix = podman secret + Secret= (queued post-green).
[Container]
Image=docker.io/bitnamilegacy/minio:latest
ContainerName=minio
Network=aether
EnvironmentFile=/home/dev/.config/aether/secrets.env
Volume=minio_data:/data
PublishPort=127.0.0.1:9010:9000
PublishPort=127.0.0.1:9011:9001

[Service]
Restart=always
TimeoutStartSec=120
MemoryMax=1G
CPUQuota=50%
